    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n63125" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λῐθ-άς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">άδος</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίθος</span>
			, <i>stone</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σεῦεν κύνας . . πυκνῇσιν λιθάδεσσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					14.36
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θάλαμον δέμον . . πυκνῇσιν λ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					23.193
				</span></i>
			; collectively, <i>shower of stones</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Th.</u>
				158
			</span></i> (lyr.); <i>heap of stones</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιθάδας τε καὶ ἕρμακας ἐνναίοντες</span>, of snakes,
				<i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				150
			</span></i> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίθακας</span>
			).</div>
